     "bf075b27-33d1-4187-bce6-97ff35b0cd65"], Cell[
    "Circles are defined from congruence, not postulated.", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"143ef225-6719-4fd4-9ad8-34128f836553"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "6d5be9d6-a12d-44b8-8f7c-e6072daca5a7"], Cell[
